# Dynamic TA composite row / delta wire

- 背景：runtime v1只有row-kind + single dataRef，無法表達同row多trace；deployed poll可繪圖但會投影完整bounded series。
- 目標：additive multi-trace document contract、renderer與真正delta browser wire，維持legacy single-series相容。
- 驗收：contract/reducer/renderer/PTCS adapter tests、2000-bar四列Playwright、fresh reconnect。
- 風險：exact NuGet cascade、legacy E2EQ adapter、initial snapshot size與WebSharper DOM bound。
